	// V2GeoSearch Search Cities (v2)
	//
	// Search for cities by name prefix for autocomplete functionality.
	//
	// **Authentication Required:**
	// - Requires a valid `x-api-key` header.
	//
	// **Cost:**
	// - **Free Tier:** 1 Credit per request.
	// - **Paid Tiers (Entry, High):** 0 Credits (Unlimited).
	//
	// Use it to help users select the correct city before making astrology calculations.
	//
	// **Example usage:**
	// - `/api/v2/geo/search?q=par` → Returns Paris (FR), Paris (US), Paraná, etc.
	// - `/api/v2/geo/search?q=london&country=GB` → Returns only London, UK
	// - `/api/v2/geo/search?q=Jingzhou%2C%20Hubei` → Returns Jingzhou in Hubei, China
	// - `/api/v2/geo/search?q=Hubei%20Jingzhou` → Also returns Jingzhou in Hubei, China
	// - `/api/v2/geo/search?q=Jingzhou%20City%2C%20Hubei%20Province` → Accepts optional administrative suffixes
	//
	// Results are sorted by population (largest cities first).
	//
	// **Note:** This is the new v2 endpoint. The v1 endpoint (/api/v1/geo/search)
	// remains free without API key until February 3, 2026, after which it will be deprecated.
	//
	// Corresponds with GET /api/v2/geo/search (the `V2GeoSearch` operationId).
