// V1WesternProgressionsSecondaryWithBody Get Secondary Progressions
//
// Compute a secondary progressed chart using the classic symbolic timing rule:
// 1 day after birth = 1 year of life.
//
// `target_date` accepts either `YYYY-MM-DD` or a full ISO datetime. Date-only values
// are normalized to `00:00:00Z`. The endpoint returns the explicit progressed datetime
// basis, the progressed chart, and optional movement/lifecycle/timeline expansions.
//
// `orb_deg` is the maximum orb used for aspect detection and exact-hit refinement.
// Timeline mode is opt-in through the `include=timeline` expansion and scans forward
// from the target date for exact aspects, ingresses, stations, and major moon phases.
//
// Takes any type of body and a specified content type.
//
